    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "SoftwareApplication",
        "name": "CryptoAgent Guard",
        "description": "AI 代理交易指令本地安全审计工具，保护加密货币交易安全",
        "applicationCategory": "SecurityApplication",
        "operatingSystem": "Web",
        "price": "0",
        "offers": {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "price": "0",
            "priceCurrency": "USD"
        },
        "author": {
            "@type": "Organization",
            "name": "CryptoAgent Guard"
        },
        "url": "https://www.wangdadi.xyz/cryptoagentguard"
    }
    </script>
    
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "mainEntity": [
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "如何本地验证加密交易安全？",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "使用 CryptoAgent Guard，您可以在本地环境中验证 AI 生成的交易指令。工具会自动检测授权风险、钓鱼地址、大额交易等安全威胁，无需连接第三方服务器，保护您的私钥安全。"
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "什么是 Approve 授权风险？",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "Approve 授权允许智能合约访问您钱包中的代币。如果授权给恶意合约或未知地址，攻击者可以转移您的所有资产。CryptoAgent Guard 会检测授权目标是否为已知可信协议，并标记风险。"
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "工具支持哪些区块链网络？",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "CryptoAgent Guard 支持以太坊、币安智能链(BSC)、Solana、Polygon、Arbitrum 等主流区块链网络，自动识别链 ID 并验证地址格式。"
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "为什么需要本地审计？",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "本地审计确保您的交易数据和私钥不会发送到任何第三方服务器，避免数据泄露风险。所有计算都在浏览器中完成，保护您的资产安全。"
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "如何识别钓鱼地址？",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "钓鱼地址通常模仿知名协议地址，或包含特殊后缀如 dead、beef、cafe 等。CryptoAgent Guard 会检测这些特征模式，并与已知协议白名单比对，提醒您验证地址真实性。"
                }
            }
        ]
    }
    </script>
    
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #0d1117;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: 'Consolas', 'Monaco', 'Courier New', monospace;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            background-color: #161b22;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
        }

        /* Breadcrumb */
        .breadcrumb {
            background-color: #0d1117;
            padding: 10px 30px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .breadcrumb a {
            color: #58a6ff;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .breadcrumb a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .breadcrumb-separator {
            color: #8b949e;
            margin: 0 8px;
        }

        .breadcrumb span:last-child {
            color: #c9d1d9;
        }

        header h1 {
            color: #238636;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        header p {
            color: #8b949e;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        /* Main Content */
        .main-content {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            padding: 20px;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        /* Input Area */
        .input-area {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .input-area label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #8b949e;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .input-area textarea {
            flex: 1;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #161b22;
            border: 1px solid #30363d;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 15px;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: inherit;
            font-size: 14px;
            resize: none;
        }

        .input-area textarea:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #238636;
        }

        /* Audit Panel */
        .audit-panel {
            width: 450px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .panel-section {
            background-color: #161b22;
            border: 1px solid #30363d;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 15px;
        }

        .panel-section h3 {
            color: #238636;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
        }

        /* Security Score */
        .security-score {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .score-display {
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #238636;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .score-status {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #8b949e;
        }

        /* Risk Checklist */
        .risk-checklist {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .risk-checklist li {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 8px 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #c9d1d9;
        }

        .risk-checklist .status-icon {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin-right: 10px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .risk-checklist .status-safe {
            background-color: #238636;
        }

        .risk-checklist .status-warning {
            background-color: #d29922;
        }

        .risk-checklist .status-danger {
            background-color: #f85149;
        }

        /* Gas Estimate */
        .gas-info {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
        }

        .gas-info:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .gas-label {
            color: #8b949e;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .gas-value {
            color: #c9d1d9;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* Action Bar */
        .action-bar {
            background-color: #161b22;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #30363d;
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-family: inherit;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
        }

        .btn-audit {
            background-color: #238636;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .btn-audit:hover {
            background-color: #2ea043;
        }

        .btn-reset {
            background-color: #30363d;
            color: #c9d1d9;
        }

        .btn-reset:hover {
            background-color: #3d444d;
        }

        .btn-copy {
            background-color: #58a6ff;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .btn-copy:hover {
            background-color: #79c0ff;
        }

        .btn-copy.copied {
            background-color: #238636;
        }

        .btn-snapshot {
            background-color: #a371f7;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .btn-snapshot:hover {
            background-color: #b388ff;
        }

        .btn-snapshot.snapshotted {
            background-color: #238636;
        }

        .audit-panel.danger-border {
            border: 2px solid #da3633 !important;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(218, 54, 51, 0.3);
        }

        .error-message {
            color: #da3633;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            background-color: rgba(218, 54, 51, 0.1);
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .success-message {
            color: #238636;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            background-color: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.1);
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .status-safe-text {
            color: #238636;
        }

        .status-warning-text {
            color: #d29922;
        }

        .status-danger-text {
            color: #da3633;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .main-content {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            
            .audit-panel {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            header {
                padding: 15px 20px;
            }
            
            header h1 {
                font-size: 22px;
            }
            
            .main-content {
                padding: 15px;
            }
            
            .action-bar {
                padding: 15px 20px;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }
            
            .btn {
                flex: 1;
                min-width: 120px;
            }
        }

        /* Security Rules Section */
        .security-rules {
            background-color: #161b22;
            border: 1px solid #30363d;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px;
        }

        .security-rules h2 {
            color: #238636;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
        }

        .geo-description {
            color: #8b949e;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding: 12px;
            background-color: #0d1117;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border-left: 3px solid #238636;
        }

        .geo-description strong {
            color: #58a6ff;
        }

        .rule-item {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .rule-item:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .rule-item h3 {
            color: #c9d1d9;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-weight: normal;
        }

        .rule-item p {
            color: #8b949e;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* FAQ Section */
        .faq-section {
            background-color: #161b22;
            border: 1px solid #30363d;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px;
        }

        .faq-section h2 {
            color: #238636;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
        }

        .faq-item {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .faq-item:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .faq-item h3 {
            color: #c9d1d9;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: normal;
        }

        .faq-item p {
            color: #8b949e;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* Methodology Section */
        .methodology-section {
            background-color: #161b22;
            border: 1px solid #30363d;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px;
        }

        .methodology-section details {
            color: #c9d1d9;
        }

        .methodology-section summary {
            cursor: pointer;
            outline: none;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .methodology-section summary::-webkit-details-marker {
            display: none;
        }

        .methodology-section summary h2 {
            color: #238636;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
        }

        .methodology-content {
            padding-top: 15px;
        }

        .methodology-item {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: #0d1117;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .methodology-item:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .methodology-item h3 {
            color: #58a6ff;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: normal;
        }

        .methodology-item p {
            color: #8b949e;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .methodology-item p:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .methodology-item ul {
            margin: 10px 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        .methodology-item li {
            color: #8b949e;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .methodology-item li:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .methodology-item code {
            background-color: #30363d;
            color: #f0883e;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: #161b22;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #30363d;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: #58a6ff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 13px;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            background-color: #0d1117;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border: 1px solid #30363d;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            background-color: #21262d;
            border-color: #58a6ff;
        }

        footer p {
            color: #8b949e;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        footer p:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>CryptoAgent Guard</h1>
        <p>AI 代理交易指令本地安全审计</p>
    </header>

    <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="https://www.wangdadi.xyz" target="_blank">Home</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb-separator">/</span>
        <span>CryptoAgent Guard</span>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <div class="main-content">
            <div class="input-area">
                <label for="input-data">AI 生成的 JSON 交易对象或原始指令</label>
                <textarea id="input-data" placeholder='{"chainId": 1, "to": "0x...", "value": "0", "data": "0x..."}'></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="audit-panel">
                <div class="panel-section security-score">
                    <h3>安全评分 (Security Score)</h3>
                    <div class="score-display">--</div>
                    <div class="score-status">等待审计</div>
                </div>

                <div class="panel-section">
                    <h3>风险检测清单 (Risk Checklist)</h3>
                    <ul class="risk-checklist">
                        <li><span class="status-icon"></span> 合约地址验证</li>
                        <li><span class="status-icon"></span> 交易金额检查</li>
                        <li><span class="status-icon"></span> 授权限额审查</li>
                        <li><span class="status-icon"></span> 重入攻击检测</li>
                        <li><span class="status-icon"></span> 合约交互白名单</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="panel-section">
                    <h3>预估 Gas 消耗 (Gas Estimate)</h3>
                    <div class="gas-info">
                        <span class="gas-label">预估 Gas</span>
                        <span class="gas-value">--</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="gas-info">
                        <span class="gas-label">Gas 价格</span>
                        <span class="gas-value">--</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="gas-info">
                        <span class="gas-label">总费用 (ETH)</span>
                        <span class="gas-value">--</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="action-bar">
            <button class="btn btn-audit" id="btn-audit">开始本地审计</button>
            <button class="btn btn-reset" id="btn-reset">重置</button>
            <button class="btn btn-copy" id="btn-copy" disabled>复制审计报告</button>
            <button class="btn btn-snapshot" id="btn-snapshot" disabled>生成审计快照</button>
        </div>
        
        <div id="message-area"></div>

        <article class="security-rules" aria-label="安全审计规则说明">
            <h2>安全审计规则说明</h2>
            <p class="geo-description">CryptoAgent Guard 是一款专业的 <strong>Local crypto transaction validator</strong>，为 AI agent wallet safety check 提供可靠的解决方案。</p>
            <div class="rule-item" id="address-validation">
                <h3>合约地址验证 (Address checksum verification tool)</h3>
                <p>作为 <strong>Ethereum transaction payload inspector</strong>，验证目标地址是否符合所选区块链的地址格式规范，检测零地址、黑洞地址和钓鱼特征地址。支持以太坊 EIP-55 checksum 校验。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rule-item" id="amount-check">
                <h3>交易金额检查</h3>
                <p>监控大额资产转移，智能识别金额阈值。超过 10 ETH 触发警告，超过 100 ETH 标记为极高风险，防止意外的大额资产流失。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rule-item" id="approve-review">
                <h3>授权限额审查</h3>
                <p>检测 approve、transferFrom、setApprovalForAll 等高风险函数，验证授权目标是否为已知可信协议。识别无限授权风险，保障 AI agent wallet safety。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rule-item" id="slippage-check">
                <h3>滑点校验 (重入攻击检测)</h3>
                <p>检查滑点设置是否超过安全阈值（5%），防止 MEV 攻击和三明治攻击。保护交易不被夹持，确保 AI 代理执行预期操作。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rule-item" id="whitelist-check">
                <h3>合约交互白名单</h3>
                <p>比对目标地址与已知 DeFi 协议白名单（包括 Uniswap、Aave、Compound、MakerDAO 等），识别未知合约交互风险。</p>
            </div>
        </article>

        <section class="faq-section">
            <h2>常见问题 (FAQ)</h2>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>如何本地验证加密交易安全？</h3>
                <p>CryptoAgent Guard 作为一款专业的 <strong>Local crypto transaction validator</strong>，可在浏览器本地完成交易验证，无需 RPC 连接或第三方 API。您只需粘贴 AI Agent 生成的交易指令，即可获得地址校验、金额检查、Gas 预估等完整审计报告，确保私钥永不离开本地环境。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>什么是 Approve 授权风险？</h3>
                <p>ERC-20 的 <code>approve()</code> 函数允许指定合约代为提取固定配额代币。若授权给恶意合约，攻击者可利用 <strong>无限授权</strong> 机制转移全部资产。<strong>AI agent wallet safety check</strong> 模块会验证授权目标是否为可信协议合约（如 Uniswap V2/V3 Router、Compound cToken 等），并对未知地址发出高危预警。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>setApprovalForAll 为什么更危险？</h3>
                <p>与 approve 不同，<code>setApprovalForAll</code> 用于 ERC-721/1155 NFT 授权。一旦授权，合约可以转移您持有的<strong>全部 NFT</strong>。本工具会将此操作标记为「极端风险」，并附带红色警示边框。建议仅对经过完全审计的知名 NFT  marketplaces 使用此授权。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>工具支持哪些区块链网络？</h3>
                <p>作为多链 <strong>Ethereum transaction payload inspector</strong>，CryptoAgent Guard 支持：以太坊主网（EIP-155）、币安智能链（BSC）、Solana（Base58 地址）、Polygon、Arbitrum One。所有链均包含地址格式校验和 Gas 估算功能。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>如何进行 Address checksum verification？</h3>
                <p>以太坊地址支持 EIP-55 混合大小写校验和。本工具使用正则 <code>/^0x[a-f0-9]{40}$/i</code> 基础格式验证，检测零地址（0x000...000）和黑洞地址（0x000...dead）。钓鱼地址通常包含可疑尾缀（dead、beef、cafe），均会被识别并警告。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>为什么需要本地审计而非在线工具？</h3>
                <p>本地审计实现<strong>零数据传输</strong>：您的交易指令、钱包地址、签名信息绝不会发送到任何服务器。这对于保护 AI Agent 操作的高价值钱包尤为关键。所有计算（正则匹配、Gas 估算、评分）均在 WebAssembly/JavaScript 沙箱中完成。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Gas 估算如何工作？</h3>
                <p>工具根据交易类型识别自动计算：<strong>ETH Transfer</strong> 约 21,000 gas，<strong>ERC-20 Approve</strong> 约 50,000 gas，<strong>Uniswap V2 Swap</strong> 约 150,000 gas。结合当前网络平均 Gwei（以太坊 30 Gwei，BSC 5 Gwei）计算总费用，帮助您评估交易成本。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>审计评分如何计算？</h3>
                <p>基础分 100 分，根据检测结果逐项扣减：黑洞地址 -40、钓鱼地址特征 -30、授权未知合约 -30、大额转账(>10 ETH) -15、无限授权风险 -20、滑点超 5% -10。评分 ≥80 为安全，60-79 为中等风险，40-59 为高风险，&lt;40 为极高风险。</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="methodology-section">
            <details open>
                <summary>
                    <h2>Security Audit Methodology（审计方法论）</h2>
                </summary>
                <div class="methodology-content">
                    <div class="methodology-item" id="methodology-address">
                        <h3>1. 地址验证机制</h3>
                        <p><strong>以太坊地址格式校验：</strong>使用正则表达式 <code>/^0x[a-f0-9]{40}$/i</code> 验证十六进制地址格式。</p>
                        <p><strong>Solana地址格式校验：</strong>使用正则表达式 <code>/^[1-9A-HJ-NP-Za-km-z]{32,44}$/</code> 验证 Base58 编码地址。</p>
                        <p><strong>黑洞地址检测：</strong>比对已知黑洞地址列表（如 0x000...0000, 0x000...dead）。</p>
                        <p><strong>钓鱼地址模式识别：</strong>检测地址末尾是否包含可疑后缀（dead, beef, cafe）。</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="methodology-item" id="methodology-highrisk">
                        <h3>2. 高危函数检测</h3>
                        <p><strong>授权函数检测：</strong>使用正则匹配 <code>approve\(</code>, <code>transferFrom\(</code>, <code>setApprovalForAll\(</code>, <code>increaseAllowance\(</code>, <code>decreaseAllowance\(</code>, <code>safeTransferFrom\(</code>。</p>
                        <p><strong>协议白名单验证：</strong>将授权目标地址与已知可信协议列表比对（如 Uniswap, Aave, Compound 等）。</p>
                        <p><strong>风险评估：</strong>若授权目标非已知协议，标记为极高风险并扣除相应分数。</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="methodology-item" id="methodology-amount">
                        <h3>3. 交易金额监控</h3>
                        <p><strong>大额预警阈值：</strong>交易金额超过 10 ETH 触发警告，超过 100 ETH 标记极高风险。</p>
                        <p><strong>数值解析：</strong>支持解析 JSON 中的 value 字段和自然语言描述中的金额。</p>
                        <p><strong>单位识别：</strong>自动识别 ETH, BNB, SOL, wei, gwei 等单位。</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="methodology-item" id="methodology-gas">
                        <h3>4. Gas 消耗估算</h3>
                        <p><strong>操作类型识别：</strong>根据输入内容识别 Transfer、Swap、Approve、合约部署等操作类型。</p>
                        <p><strong>Gas 基准值：</strong>Transfer 约 21,000 gas，Swap 约 120,000-150,000 gas，Approve 约 45,000-50,000 gas。</p>
                        <p><strong>费用计算：</strong>结合当前网络平均 Gwei 价格计算预估费用。</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="methodology-item" id="methodology-scoring">
                        <h3>5. 评分算法</h3>
                        <p><strong>基础分：</strong>100 分</p>
                        <p><strong>扣分项：</strong></p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>高风险函数检测到但目标为已知协议：-20 分</li>
                            <li>高风险函数授权给未知地址：-50 分（额外-30分）</li>
                            <li>地址格式无效：-15 分</li>
                            <li>黑洞地址检测：-40 分</li>
                            <li>钓鱼地址特征：-30 分</li>
                            <li>大额交易（10-100 ETH）：-15 分</li>
                            <li>大额交易（>100 ETH）：-35 分（额外-20分）</li>
                            <li>滑点超过 5%：-10 分</li>
                            <li>未知合约地址：-10 分</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p><strong>等级划分：</strong></p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>SAFE（安全）：80-100 分</li>
                            <li>WARNING（中等风险）：60-79 分</li>
                            <li>HIGH RISK（高风险）：40-59 分</li>
                            <li>CRITICAL（极高风险）：0-39 分</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </details>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="footer-links">
